<%# ── Sales Verification (Electronic Payments) ──────────────────────────────────
    Always visible (once permitted via view_sales_transactions_verification),
    regardless of whether a Sales file has been imported. Rendered in the LEFT
    column of the two-column grid in show.html.erb (Audit Timeline is the right
    column). Owns two blocks:
      - Session Totals table — each payment-method ROW is itself the
        collapsible's trigger (data-controller="collapsible" wraps the row +
        its own expanded content, which sits directly beneath that row);
        clicking it reveals that payment method's own Sales Transactions
        table (plus its WorkPulse refund records, for traceability) in place,
        right under the row that was clicked. Every row shares
        data-collapsible-group-value="session-totals-payment-methods" (see
        collapsible_controller.js) so only one payment method is expanded at
        a time — an accordion. The Grand Total row stays a plain,
        non-collapsible row, unchanged. No separate cards exist below the
        table anymore.
      - Employee Breakdown (below) — rendered via the "employee_summary"
        partial; replaces the old standalone "Cashier Custody Summary" card,
        which no longer exists as a separate section anywhere on the page.

    Locals: sales_totals_by_method, sales_difference, can_manage_sales_import,
            session_totals_rows, session_totals_grand_total.

    All figures are computed once in Finance::DailyReconciliationsController
    (build_show_summary_aggregates / build_session_totals_rows) and reused
    here and in _employee_summary.html.erb (which reads the remaining
    aggregates — @employee_summaries, @sales_totals_by_cashier,
    @all_payment_methods_for_cards, @electronic_payment_methods — directly as
    ivars) — no recalculation.

    Gross/Refund/Net — WorkPulse side comes straight off TillSessionAmount
    (collected_amount / refund_amount / net_amount), which already folds
    independent TillRefund records in exactly once (sync_session_amounts!).
    Imported side comes from SalesTransaction#refund? (transaction_type) via
    @sales_totals_by_method — never guessed, never defaulted to cash. Neither
    figure is recalculated here; this partial only renders what the
    controller already computed. %>

<% has_sales_data = sales_totals_by_method.any? %>

<section id="electronic-payments" class="recon-section" data-controller="accordion" data-accordion-key-value="sales-verification">
  <div class="dashboard-section__header recon-accordion__header">
    <div class="recon-accordion__trigger" data-accordion-target="trigger" data-action="click->accordion#toggle keydown.enter->accordion#toggle keydown.space->accordion#toggle" role="button" tabindex="0" aria-expanded="false">
      <span class="recon-accordion__chevron" data-accordion-target="icon" aria-hidden="true">▶</span>
      <div>
        <h2 class="dashboard-section__title"><%= t("finance.sales_imports.verification.title") %></h2>
        <p style="font-size: var(--text-xs); color: var(--text-2); margin: var(--space-1) 0 0;">
          <%= t("finance.sales_imports.verification.subtitle") %>
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: var(--space-3);">
      <% if !has_sales_data %>
        <span class="badge badge-neutral"><%= t("finance.sales_imports.verification.status_not_imported") %></span>
      <% else %>
        <% verified = sales_difference.abs < 0.01 %>
        <span class="badge <%= verified ? 'badge-success' : 'badge-warning' %>">
          <%= verified ? t("finance.sales_imports.verification.status_verified") : t("finance.sales_imports.verification.status_difference") %>
        </span>
      <% end %>
      <% if can_manage_sales_import %>
        <%= link_to(has_sales_data ? t("finance.sales_imports.verification.reimport") : t("finance.daily_reconciliations.show.sections.electronic.import_button"),
              new_finance_sales_import_path, class: "btn btn-ghost btn-sm") %>
      <% end %>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="recon-accordion__panel" data-accordion-target="content">
  <div class="recon-accordion__panel-inner">

  <%# ── Session Totals: daily sales overview, ALL payment methods (cash + electronic
      when the viewer holds view_session_totals; electronic-only otherwise).
      Gross Sales − Refunds = Net Sales for every payment method (and grand
      total) — refunds are always shown as their own column, never silently
      subtracted out of a single figure. ── %>
  <div style="background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: var(--radius-lg); overflow: hidden; box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm); margin-bottom: var(--dr-header-gap);">
    <div style="padding: var(--dr-card-title-py) var(--space-5); background: var(--surface-2); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);">
      <h3 style="font-size: var(--text-sm); font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-1); margin: 0;">
        <%= t("finance.daily_reconciliations.show.sections.electronic.session_totals_title") %>
      </h3>
    </div>
    <div class="session-totals-table">
      <div class="session-totals-table__row session-totals-table__row--header" style="padding: var(--dr-header-row-py) var(--space-5); background: var(--surface-2); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);">
        <span style="font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.06em; color: var(--text-3);"><%= t("finance.daily_reconciliations.show.sections.electronic.col_payment_method") %></span>
        <span style="font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.06em; color: var(--text-3); text-align: end;"><%= t("finance.daily_reconciliations.show.sections.electronic.col_gross_sales") %></span>
        <span style="font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.06em; color: var(--text-3); text-align: end;"><%= t("finance.daily_reconciliations.show.sections.electronic.col_refunds") %></span>
        <span style="font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.06em; color: var(--text-3); text-align: end;"><%= t("finance.daily_reconciliations.show.sections.electronic.col_workpulse_total") %></span>
        <span style="font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.06em; color: var(--text-3); text-align: end;"><%= t("finance.daily_reconciliations.show.sections.electronic.col_sales_total") %></span>
        <span style="font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.06em; color: var(--text-3); text-align: end;"><%= t("finance.daily_reconciliations.show.sections.electronic.col_difference") %></span>
      </div>

      <%# ── Each payment-method row IS the disclosure trigger — clicking it
          expands that payment method's Sales Transactions table (plus any
          WorkPulse refund records) directly underneath, in place.
          data-collapsible-group-value ties every row together into one
          accordion group (collapsible_controller.js) so opening one closes
          whichever other row was open. Reuses @sales_transactions_by_payment_method
          and @till_refunds_by_payment_method (already grouped in the
          controller from already-loaded arrays — no query here). ── %>
      <% session_totals_rows.each do |r| %>
        <% pm_id = r[:payment_method].id %>
        <% pm_transactions = @sales_transactions_by_payment_method[pm_id] || [] %>
        <% pm_refunds       = @till_refunds_by_payment_method[pm_id] || [] %>
        <div data-controller="collapsible" data-collapsible-group-value="session-totals-payment-methods" class="recon-disclosure">
          <button type="button" data-collapsible-target="trigger" data-action="click->collapsible#toggle"
                  class="recon-disclosure__trigger session-totals-table__row" aria-expanded="false"
                  style="align-items: center; padding: var(--dr-row-py) var(--space-5); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); color: inherit; font-weight: normal; text-align: start;">
            <span style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: var(--space-2); font-size: var(--text-sm); color: var(--text-2);">
              <svg class="recon-disclosure__chevron" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" aria-hidden="true">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="m19.5 8.25-7.5 7.5-7.5-7.5"/>
              </svg>
              <%= r[:payment_method].display_name %>
              <% if pm_refunds.any? %>
                <span class="badge badge-neutral" style="font-size: 10px;" title="<%= t("finance.daily_reconciliations.show.sections.electronic.refunds_traceable_hint") %>">
                  <%= pm_refunds.size %> <%= t("finance.daily_reconciliations.show.sections.electronic.refund_count_suffix") %>
                </span>
              <% end %>
            </span>
            <span data-label="<%= t("finance.daily_reconciliations.show.sections.electronic.col_gross_sales") %>" style="font-size: var(--text-sm); color: var(--text-2); text-align: end; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;"><%= format_currency(r[:workpulse_gross]) %></span>
            <span data-label="<%= t("finance.daily_reconciliations.show.sections.electronic.col_refunds") %>" style="font-size: var(--text-sm); text-align: end; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; color: <%= r[:workpulse_refund].zero? ? 'var(--text-3)' : 'var(--danger,#dc2626)' %>;">
              <%= r[:workpulse_refund].zero? ? "—" : "− #{format_currency(r[:workpulse_refund])}" %>
            </span>
            <span data-label="<%= t("finance.daily_reconciliations.show.sections.electronic.col_workpulse_total") %>" style="font-size: var(--text-sm); font-weight: 600; color: var(--text-1); text-align: end; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;"><%= format_currency(r[:workpulse_total]) %></span>
            <span data-label="<%= t("finance.daily_reconciliations.show.sections.electronic.col_sales_total") %>" style="font-size: var(--text-sm); font-weight: 600; color: var(--text-1); text-align: end; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;">
              <%= r[:sales_total] ? format_currency(r[:sales_total]) : "—" %>
            </span>
            <span data-label="<%= t("finance.daily_reconciliations.show.sections.electronic.col_difference") %>" style="font-size: var(--text-sm); font-weight: 600; text-align: end; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; color: <%= (r[:difference].nil? || r[:difference].abs < 0.01) ? 'var(--text-3)' : (r[:difference] > 0 ? 'var(--warning)' : 'var(--danger)') %>;">
              <%= (r[:difference].nil? || r[:difference].abs < 0.01) ? "—" : format_currency(r[:difference]) %>
            </span>
          </button>
          <div data-collapsible-target="content" hidden style="border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);">
            <div style="padding: var(--dr-panel-py) var(--space-5);">

              <%# ── Imported Sales Transactions — refund rows clearly marked,
                  never rendered as an ordinary sale. Amount shown signed
                  (negative for a refund) so the column can be summed
                  directly: Gross − Refunds = Net. ── %>
              <% if pm_transactions.blank? %>
                <p style="color: var(--text-3); margin: 0 0 var(--space-3);">
                  <%= t("finance.daily_reconciliations.show.sections.electronic.no_sales_transactions") %>
                </p>
              <% else %>
                <% pm_sales_totals = sales_totals_by_method[pm_id] %>
                <% if pm_sales_totals %>
                  <p style="font-size: var(--text-xs); color: var(--text-2); margin: 0 0 var(--space-2);">
                    <%= t("finance.daily_reconciliations.show.sections.electronic.imported_summary_line",
                          gross:  format_currency(pm_sales_totals[:gross]),
                          refund: format_currency(pm_sales_totals[:refund]),
                          net:    format_currency(pm_sales_totals[:net])) %>
                  </p>
                <% end %>
                <div class="recon-table-scroll">
                  <table class="table">
                    <thead>
                      <tr>
                        <th><%= t("finance.daily_reconciliations.show.sections.electronic.col_sale_number") %></th>
                        <th><%= t("finance.daily_reconciliations.show.sections.electronic.col_reference_number") %></th>
                        <th><%= t("finance.daily_reconciliations.show.sections.electronic.col_type") %></th>
                        <th><%= t("finance.daily_reconciliations.show.sections.electronic.col_time") %></th>
                        <th class="text-end"><%= t("finance.daily_reconciliations.show.sections.electronic.col_amount") %></th>
                      </tr>
                    </thead>
                    <tbody>
                      <% pm_transactions.each do |txn| %>
                        <tr style="<%= 'background: rgba(220,38,38,0.04);' if txn.refund? %>">
                          <td><code style="font-size: var(--text-xs);"><%= txn.sale_number.presence || "—" %></code></td>
                          <td><code style="font-size: var(--text-xs);"><%= txn.reference_number.presence || "—" %></code></td>
                          <td>
                            <% if txn.refund? %>
                              <span class="badge" style="font-size: 10px; background: rgba(220,38,38,0.10); border: 1px solid rgba(220,38,38,0.30); color: var(--danger,#dc2626); font-weight: 700;">
                                <%= t("finance.daily_reconciliations.show.sections.electronic.type_refund") %>
                              </span>
                            <% else %>
                              <span class="badge badge-neutral" style="font-size: 10px;">
                                <%= t("finance.daily_reconciliations.show.sections.electronic.type_sale") %>
                              </span>
                            <% end %>
                          </td>
                          <td><%= txn.transaction_time&.strftime("%H:%M:%S") || "—" %></td>
                          <td class="text-end" style="font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; <%= 'color: var(--danger,#dc2626); font-weight: 600;' if txn.refund? %>">
                            <%= format_currency(txn.signed_amount) %>
                          </td>
                        </tr>
                      <% end %>
                    </tbody>
                  </table>
                </div>
              <% end %>

              <%# ── WorkPulse Refunds (TillRefund) — traceability back to the
                  actual independent refund records behind this payment
                  method's Refunds figure above. Only rendered when at least
                  one exists; never invents a row. ── %>
              <% if pm_refunds.any? %>
                <p style="font-size: var(--text-xs); font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.06em; color: var(--text-3); margin: var(--space-4) 0 var(--space-2);">
                  <%= t("finance.daily_reconciliations.show.sections.electronic.workpulse_refunds_heading") %>
                </p>
                <div class="recon-table-scroll">
                  <table class="table">
                    <thead>
                      <tr>
                        <th><%= t("finance.daily_reconciliations.show.sections.electronic.col_time") %></th>
                        <th><%= t("finance.daily_reconciliations.show.sections.electronic.col_processed_by") %></th>
                        <th><%= t("finance.daily_reconciliations.show.sections.electronic.col_notes") %></th>
                        <th class="text-end"><%= t("finance.daily_reconciliations.show.sections.electronic.col_amount") %></th>
                      </tr>
                    </thead>
                    <tbody>
                      <% pm_refunds.each do |refund| %>
                        <tr>
                          <td><%= l(refund.refunded_at, format: :long) %></td>
                          <td><%= refund.processed_by.full_name %></td>
                          <td style="color: var(--text-2); font-style: italic;"><%= refund.notes.presence || "—" %></td>
                          <td class="text-end" style="font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; color: var(--danger,#dc2626); font-weight: 600;">
                            − <%= format_currency(refund.amount) %>
                          </td>
                        </tr>
                      <% end %>
                    </tbody>
                  </table>
                </div>
              <% end %>

            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      <% end %>

      <%# ── Grand Total — always a plain row, never collapsible. ── %>
      <div class="session-totals-table__row" style="padding: var(--dr-total-row-py) var(--space-5); background: var(--surface-2); align-items: center;">
        <span style="font-size: var(--text-sm); font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-1);"><%= t("finance.sales_imports.verification.grand_total") %></span>
        <span data-label="<%= t("finance.daily_reconciliations.show.sections.electronic.col_gross_sales") %>" style="font-size: var(--text-sm); color: var(--text-2); text-align: end; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;"><%= format_currency(session_totals_grand_total[:workpulse_gross]) %></span>
        <span data-label="<%= t("finance.daily_reconciliations.show.sections.electronic.col_refunds") %>" style="font-size: var(--text-sm); text-align: end; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; color: <%= session_totals_grand_total[:workpulse_refund].zero? ? 'var(--text-3)' : 'var(--danger,#dc2626)' %>;">
          <%= session_totals_grand_total[:workpulse_refund].zero? ? "—" : "− #{format_currency(session_totals_grand_total[:workpulse_refund])}" %>
        </span>
        <span data-label="<%= t("finance.daily_reconciliations.show.sections.electronic.col_workpulse_total") %>" style="font-size: var(--text-sm); font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-1); text-align: end; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;"><%= format_currency(session_totals_grand_total[:workpulse_total]) %></span>
        <span data-label="<%= t("finance.daily_reconciliations.show.sections.electronic.col_sales_total") %>" style="font-size: var(--text-sm); font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-1); text-align: end; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;">
          <%= session_totals_grand_total[:sales_total] ? format_currency(session_totals_grand_total[:sales_total]) : "—" %>
        </span>
        <span data-label="<%= t("finance.daily_reconciliations.show.sections.electronic.col_difference") %>" style="font-size: var(--text-sm); font-weight: 700; text-align: end; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; color: <%= (session_totals_grand_total[:difference].nil? || session_totals_grand_total[:difference].abs < 0.01) ? 'var(--text-3)' : 'var(--warning)' %>;">
          <%= (session_totals_grand_total[:difference].nil? || session_totals_grand_total[:difference].abs < 0.01) ? "—" : format_currency(session_totals_grand_total[:difference]) %>
        </span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  </div>
  </div>
</section>

<%# ── Employee Breakdown — its own independent accordion ("Sales Verification
    Summary"), replacing the old standalone "Cashier Custody Summary" card.
    Rendered as a sibling of, not nested inside, the Sales Verification
    section above — see _employee_summary.html.erb for its own accordion
    wrapper (id="sales-verification-summary"). ── %>
<%= render "employee_summary" %>
